test("evaluateWebrtcSctpRfc8831Rfc8832DcepChannelOpenSpoofPpidConfusionAndStreamIdGlareGuard enforces RFC 8832 DTLS even/odd stream parity, RFC 8831 PPID whitelist & DCEP bounds (P160)", () => {
  // 1. Remote DTLS server role attempting DCEP DATA_CHANNEL_OPEN on even Stream ID 0 -> stream reset
  const parityGlareBlocked =
    evaluateWebrtcSctpRfc8831Rfc8832DcepChannelOpenSpoofPpidConfusionAndStreamIdGlareGuard({
      sctpAssociationId: "sctp-assoc-p160-01",
      remoteDtlsRole: "server",
      inboundSctpStreamId: 0,
      isDcepControlChunkPpid50: true,
      streamAlreadyOpenForSystemControlBus: false,
      sctpPayloadProtocolIdentifierPpid: 50,
      payloadValidUtf8WhenPpid51StringDeclared: true,
      dcepDeclaredLabelPlusProtocolBytesExceedPacketLength: false,
      concurrentUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 1,
      maxAllowedUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 16,
    });
  assert.equal(parityGlareBlocked.allowed, false);
  assert.equal(parityGlareBlocked.dtlsRoleStreamParityGlareOrOpenHijackReset, true);
  assert.equal(
    parityGlareBlocked.policyCode,
    "P160-WEBRTC-SCTP-RFC8831-RFC8832-DCEP-CHANNEL-OPEN-SPOOF-PPID-CONFUSION-AND-DTLS-ROLE-STREAM-ID-GLARE-GUARD"
  );
  assert.equal(
    parityGlareBlocked.actionCode,
    "RESET_SCTP_STREAM_ON_RFC8832_PARITY_GLARE_OR_DCEP_OPEN_HIJACK"
  );
  assert.equal(
    parityGlareBlocked.reason,
    "RFC8832_DTLS_ROLE_STREAM_ID_PARITY_GLARE_OR_DUPLICATE_DCEP_OPEN_HIJACK_BLOCKED"
  );

  // 2. PPID 51 WebRTC String chunk carrying malformed UTF-8 / binary injection -> drop & close
  const ppidConfusionBlocked =
    evaluateWebrtcSctpRfc8831Rfc8832DcepChannelOpenSpoofPpidConfusionAndStreamIdGlareGuard({
      sctpAssociationId: "sctp-assoc-p160-02",
      remoteDtlsRole: "client",
      inboundSctpStreamId: 2,
      isDcepControlChunkPpid50: false,
      streamAlreadyOpenForSystemControlBus: false,
      sctpPayloadProtocolIdentifierPpid: 51,
      payloadValidUtf8WhenPpid51StringDeclared: false,
      dcepDeclaredLabelPlusProtocolBytesExceedPacketLength: false,
      concurrentUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 1,
      maxAllowedUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 16,
    });
  assert.equal(ppidConfusionBlocked.allowed, false);
  assert.equal(ppidConfusionBlocked.sctpPpidConfusionOrInvalidUtf8Dropped, true);
  assert.equal(
    ppidConfusionBlocked.actionCode,
    "DROP_SCTP_CHUNK_AND_CLOSE_CHANNEL_ON_RFC8831_PPID_CONFUSION"
  );
  assert.equal(
    ppidConfusionBlocked.reason,
    "RFC8831_SCTP_PPID_TYPE_CONFUSION_OR_MALFORMED_UTF8_CONTROL_INJECTION_BLOCKED"
  );

  // 3. DCEP header Label + Protocol length exceeding packet size or unacked OPEN flood -> abort
  const dcepFloodBlocked =
    evaluateWebrtcSctpRfc8831Rfc8832DcepChannelOpenSpoofPpidConfusionAndStreamIdGlareGuard({
      sctpAssociationId: "sctp-assoc-p160-03",
      remoteDtlsRole: "client",
      inboundSctpStreamId: 4,
      isDcepControlChunkPpid50: true,
      streamAlreadyOpenForSystemControlBus: false,
      sctpPayloadProtocolIdentifierPpid: 50,
      payloadValidUtf8WhenPpid51StringDeclared: true,
      dcepDeclaredLabelPlusProtocolBytesExceedPacketLength: true,
      concurrentUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 64,
      maxAllowedUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 16,
    });
  assert.equal(dcepFloodBlocked.allowed, false);
  assert.equal(dcepFloodBlocked.dcepHeaderOobOrUnackedChannelFloodAborted, true);
  assert.equal(
    dcepFloodBlocked.actionCode,
    "ABORT_DCEP_OVERFLOW_OR_THROTTLE_UNACKED_CHANNEL_OPEN_FLOOD"
  );
  assert.equal(
    dcepFloodBlocked.reason,
    "RFC8832_DCEP_HEADER_LENGTH_OOB_OR_UNACKED_CHANNEL_FLOOD_BLOCKED"
  );

  // 4. Compliant WebRTC RFC 8831 / RFC 8832 DataChannel frame
  const compliantDataChannel =
    evaluateWebrtcSctpRfc8831Rfc8832DcepChannelOpenSpoofPpidConfusionAndStreamIdGlareGuard({
      sctpAssociationId: "sctp-assoc-p160-04",
      remoteDtlsRole: "client",
      inboundSctpStreamId: 0,
      isDcepControlChunkPpid50: false,
      streamAlreadyOpenForSystemControlBus: false,
      sctpPayloadProtocolIdentifierPpid: 51,
      payloadValidUtf8WhenPpid51StringDeclared: true,
      dcepDeclaredLabelPlusProtocolBytesExceedPacketLength: false,
      concurrentUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 2,
      maxAllowedUnackedDcepOpenStreams: 16,
    });
  assert.equal(compliantDataChannel.allowed, true);
  assert.equal(
    compliantDataChannel.actionCode,
    "ALLOW_VERIFIED_RFC8831_RFC8832_WEBRTC_DATACHANNEL_FRAME"
  );
  assert.equal(
    compliantDataChannel.reason,
    "WEBRTC_SCTP_RFC8831_PPID_AND_RFC8832_DCEP_STREAM_PARITY_VERIFIED"
  );
});

