  // 1. Chlorinator bed >=1085.0 C or <820.0 C, unreacted Cl2 slip >=2.0 vol%, or off-gas CO >=12.5 vol% with O2 >=4.5 vol% -> 0ms Cl2 DBB trip + N2 fluidization purge
