  // 3. Ambient SiH4 >= 5.0 ppm, HCl >= 5.0 ppm, amorphous SiO2 >= 0.8 mg/m3, CDO < 780C, or missing SEMI S2 SCBA LOTO -> lock CVD bell-jar hoist
